        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a customer asks you to create a case, please summarize the current conversation. The subject should be less than 7 words and function as a high level overview of what the customer inquired about. The description should be no more than 3 sentences and should provide more depth about what exactly the customer asked, important data, and any other relevant information to help a customer service representative understand the context of this conversation.</description>
